<!--
    Persian (Farsi) resources.

    The in-app dictionary in com.example.sayvis.i18n.SayvisStrings carries the full
    interface translation, because SAYVIS switches language at runtime without
    recreating the activity. These resources cover the parts Android itself renders
    (launcher label, notification and system-facing strings) so the OS surfaces stay
    Persian too when the device locale is fa.
-->
